OL,3,GNEWSA'Magical' and rare barn owl has
OL,4,Abumper breeding season
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarn owls have had a bumper summer in
OL,7,FCounty Fermanagh, with 10 chicks
OL,8,Frecorded across two sites.
OL,10,FThe breeding success follows years of
OL,11,Fconservation work by Ulster Wildlife
OL,12,Fwith local farmers installing nest
OL,13,Fboxes and improving habitat for the
OL,14,Felusive bird.
OL,16,FThere are thought to be fewer than 30
OL,17,Fbreeding pairs left in Northern
OL,18,FIreland. The chicks have had rings
OL,19,Fplaced on their legs so that they can
OL,20,Fbe recorded in any other areas they
OL,21,Fturn up in after leaving the nest.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
