OL,3,GNEWSA'Magical' and rare barn owl has
OL,4,Abumper breeding season
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being encouraged to report
OL,7,Fany sightings of barn owls across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland, particularly in the
OL,9,Fwest, to help fill in gaps in the
OL,10,Frecords and even help protect important
OL,11,Fbreeding areas.
